{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01765","headline":"杂曲歌辞 长相思三首 三 · 李白","name":"杂曲歌辞 长相思三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"美人在时花满堂，美人去後花余牀。\n牀中绣被卷不寝，至今三载犹闻香。\n香亦竟不灭，人亦竟不来。\n相思黄叶落，白露点青苔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01765.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01765","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}